Adapts the tests that fail on Amsterdam (benchmark-only):
- BlockHeader: encode the Amsterdam header fields (EIP-7928 block access list hash, EIP-7843 slot number).
- ERC20Votes, RateLimiter: the batched calls' fixed 200k gas limit can't pay the state gas (EIP-8037) of
  their first storage writes.
- ERC2771Forwarder: skip the relayer out-of-gas tests. Their gas limit is below the outer call's calldata
  floor (EIP-7976), and adapting them needs new gas numbers.

